    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In this 2D Mission, you'll create a top-down 2D version of the interactive living room scene you created earlier. Just like in the 3D scene, you'll control a character, trying to collect all the objects in a room. By completing this scene, you'll learn how working in 2D is similar to working in 3D, but also how it\u2019s different."
